					"summary": "Demonstrates full-scale LLaMA-3 architecture with 1-pass FlashAttention, Rotary Position Embeddings (RoPE), and SwiGLU activations running directly in browser.",
					"sec1Title": "1. Modern Transformer Architectural Innovations",
					"sec1Content": "<p>LLaMA-3 replaces standard transformer components with high-efficiency alternatives: RMSNorm eliminates mean tracking, RoPE provides relative rotation in complex space, and SwiGLU yields superior non-linear capacity:</p><pre><code>\\text{RMSNorm}(\\mathbf{x}) = \\frac{\\mathbf{x}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{d}\\sum x_i^2 + \\epsilon}} \\odot \\gamma, \\quad \\text{SwiGLU}(\\mathbf{x}) = (W_g \\mathbf{x} \\odot \\sigma(W_g \\mathbf{x})) \\cdot W_u \\mathbf{x}</code></pre>",
					"sec2Title": "2. FlashAttention-2 1-Pass Online Softmax Kernel",
					"sec2Content": "<p>Standard attention materializes an \\(O(N^2)\\) attention matrix. FlashAttention-2 tiles computation and computes online running softmax stats \\(m_i, \\ell_i\\) in hardware registers without VRAM memory allocation:</p><pre><code>m_{\\text{new}} = \\max(m_{\\text{prev}}, \\tilde{S}_{ij}), \\quad \\ell_{\\text{new}} = e^{m_{\\text{prev}} - m_{\\text{new}}}\\ell_{\\text{prev}} + \\sum e^{\\tilde{S}_{ij} - m_{\\text{new}}}</code></pre>",
					"sec3Title": "3. CPU vs WebGPU Architectural Execution Discrepancy",
					"sec3Content": "<p><strong>CPU Execution:</strong> Materializes full \\(N \\times N\\) attention score matrices and suffers heavy cache misses during RoPE rotational transforms.</p><p><strong>WebGPU Native Engine:</strong> Executes fused FlashAttention and RoPE compute shaders directly inside GPU registers, enabling instant autoregressive token generation in client tabs.</p>",
					"sec4Title": "4. Interactive Prompt Generation Experiment",
