					"summary": "Pairs a discrete Lagrangian mechanics physics simulator with an in-place WebGPU neural network agent optimizing actions in real time.",
					"sec1Title": "1. Lagrangian Physics Dynamics & State Space",
					"sec1Content": "<p>The CartPole system models state vector \\(\\mathbf{s} = [x, \\dot{x}, \\theta, \\dot{\\theta}]^T\\). Equations of motion derived via Euler-Lagrange equations:</p><pre><code>\\ddot{\\theta} = \\frac{g \\sin\\theta - \\cos\\theta \\left(\\frac{F + m_p l \\dot{\\theta}^2 \\sin\\theta}{m_c + m_p}\\right)}{l \\left(\\frac{4}{3} - \\frac{m_p \\cos^2\\theta}{m_c + m_p}\\right)}</code></pre>",
