					"sec2Content": "<p>The DQN agent minimizes Temporal Difference (TD) error using in-place WebGPU SGD:</p><pre><code>\\mathcal{L}(\\theta) = \\left(r + \\gamma \\max_{a'} Q(s', a'; \\theta) - Q(s, a; \\theta)\\right)^2</code></pre>",
