					"sec1Title": "1. Pipeline Abstraction Architecture",
					"sec1Content": "<p><code>forge.pipeline</code> encapsulates tokenization, model forward passes, attention pooling, and probability calibration into a unified 3-line interface:</p><pre><code>classifier = await forge.pipeline('sentiment-analysis', device='gpu')\nresult = await classifier('AMEVA-Forge is blazing fast!')</code></pre>",
					"sec2Title": "2. Attention Representation & Softmax Scoring",
					"sec2Content": "<p>Text tokens are embedded into hidden space and pooled across the sequence dimension before projection to calibrated log-odds:</p><pre><code>P(\\text{Class} = k | \\mathbf{x}) = \\frac{e^{z_k}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}</code></pre>",
					"sec3Title": "3. CPU vs WebGPU Architectural Execution Discrepancy",
